            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-xl",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>Your home should be your place of rest, but unseen forces can quietly drain your energy, disrupt your focus, and affect your health. These invisible stressors don’t always make themselves known right away—but over time, they can impact your overall wellness. <br/><br/> <br/><br/>The good news? With a few mindful adjustments, you can reduce these hidden disruptors and create a more balanced, restorative living space. </p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "s3"
          }
        },
        "image_caption_KnqYBR": {
          "type": "image_caption",
          "settings": {
