            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "95ch",
            "richtext": "<h4>The Ocean’s Role in Our World</h4><p></p><p>The oceans are more than just vast bodies of water — they are essential to life on Earth. Scientists estimate that nearly half of the oxygen we breathe is produced by the ocean*, much of it from plankton — tiny, floating plants, algae, and bacteria that photosynthesize. One tiny organism, Prochlorococcus, produces up to 20% of the oxygen in our entire biosphere, which is more than all the tropical rainforests on land combined!</p><p>As an air care brand, Blueair knows that clean air is vital to health and well-being, and our oceans play a significant role in providing the oxygen that we need. That’s why we’re proud to join forces with 4ocean to protect these vital ecosystems from the devastating impact of plastic pollution. Keeping the oceans clean helps to ensure that they can continue to support life both underwater and on land.</p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
